      "content": "To secure the mark, you must first classify the process. When ice melts, it changes state from solid to liquid, but its chemical composition ($H_2O$) remains the same. \n\nBefore we select the option, how would you distinguish between a physical change and a chemical change in terms of the molecular structure?"
